{"id":"vod_bf_45538","vodId":"45538","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"致不灭的你","name_cn":"致不灭的你","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-46/79c8cd7d9412985d51f9b00b97baee88.jpg"},"summary":"作品故事描述，某人把「球」放进这片土地。具备收集情报的机能，还可以变换各种外貌，那个球体甚至连死亡都能超越。某天，它遇见了少年，之后又分开。光线、味道、声音、温度、痛苦、喜悦、哀伤……在这个充满刺激的世界里徘徊，展开一段永恒之旅。　　由大今良时所着漫画作品《给不灭的你》，官方于今1月9日宣布改编电视动画的消息，预定将于10月在日本开播。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:14:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhibumiedeni/第15集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhi